{"post": true, "caption": "LTCM was founded in 1994 by star bond traders, with two future Nobel Prize winners as partners. For three years, it looked unbeatable.\nThe problem wasn't the brains. It was borrowing more than $25 for every $1 it owned. When Russia defaulted in 1998, small losses became huge ones, 14 banks had to step in, and the fund was shut down by 2000.\nThe lesson for beginners: your size decides whether you live long enough to be right.\nBe honest: have you ever used too much leverage? Yes or no.\n\nEducation only. Not financial advice.\n\n#CandleAndCode #StoryTime #MarketHistory #Leverage #RiskManagement", "tag": "STORY TIME", "footer": "Education only. Not financial advice.", "bpm": 92, "scenes": [{"type": "hook", "dur": 2.4, "size": 100, "lines": [{"t": "2 NOBEL WINNERS.", "c": "green"}, {"t": "$4.6B LOST.", "c": "red"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 2.8, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "Wall Street, 1994.", "c": "muted"}, {"t": "A hedge fund", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "called LTCM opens.", "c": "fg"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 2.6, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "Genius team.", "c": "green"}, {"t": "Huge early wins.", "c": "green"}, {"t": "Then this happened.", "c": "muted"}]}, {"type": "bars", "dur": 5.0, "title": "LTCM returns after fees", "subtitle": "first three years", "rows": [{"l": "Year 1", "v": 21, "vl": "+21%", "lc": "fg", "bc": "green"}, {"l": "Year 2", "v": 43, "vl": "+43%", "lc": "fg", "bc": "green"}, {"l": "Year 3", "v": 41, "vl": "+41%", "lc": "fg", "bc": "green"}]}, {"type": "stat", "dur": 2.8, "label": "early 1998, debt to equity", "value": "25 : 1", "size": 170, "note": "Borrowed $25 for every $1.", "c": "red"}, {"type": "text", "dur": 2.8, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "August 1998.", "c": "muted"}, {"t": "Russia defaults.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Markets panic.", "c": "red"}]}, {"type": "stat", "dur": 2.8, "label": "lost in under 4 months", "value": "$4.6B", "note": "14 banks had to step in.", "c": "red"}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 84, "lines": [{"t": "Being right later", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "means nothing", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "if you're out now.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 2.4, "size": 92, "lines": [{"t": "Size to survive", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "being wrong.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "end", "dur": 2.2, "line": "Trade with a system, not a feeling."}]}